{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04628","headline":"奉和圣制经邹鲁祭孔子应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制经邹鲁祭孔子应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孔圣家邹鲁，儒风蔼典坟。\n龙骖廻旧宅，凤德咏余芬。\n入室神如在，升堂乐似闻。\n悬知一王法，今日待明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}